Rovara local AWS (engine image)

This image runs two programs.

1. rovara-aws-front. A small front process written by Rovara (source: front/ in this repository). It listens on the
   run's address, answers Rovara's control paths, keeps the request ledger and forwards AWS API calls to the engine.
   It is built with the Go standard library only. The Go licence (BSD-3-Clause) is in GO-LICENSE.

2. AWS Emulator (aws-emulator), the local AWS API engine, run as a child of the front on 127.0.0.1. AWS publishes it
   (github.com/aws/aws-emulator) under CC0 1.0 Universal, except its vendor/ directory, which is Apache-2.0. The
   unmodified binary comes from AWS's signed package (the signature is verified against AWS's publishing key when the
   image is built). The third-party notices AWS ships with it are in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.

This image is built on AWS Emulator. It is not endorsed by or affiliated with Amazon Web Services.

